  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><div dir=\"ltr\">﻿<meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜</span><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><img id=\"75947386-F0E6-4E6E-A887-F23902E193CC-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_0.jpg\"><br><br><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">本日</span><span class=\"s2\"><u>10/27</u></span><span class=\"s1\">は</span><span class=\"s2\">6th</span><span class=\"s1\">シングル「</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ってか</span><span class=\"s1\">」の発売日です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">わーい！ありがとうございます！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">朝から渋谷TSUTAYAさんにお邪魔させて頂きました。サインやコメントたくさん書いたので是非見に行ってみてね。でっかい金村の写真もあります。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">毎回手の込んだパネルやポップを作ってくださって本当にありがとうございます！</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">あと朝から待機してくれたおひさまもありがとう😳</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">たくさん写真撮ってね〜！</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">そして今日は記念すべき日なので、</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">6thシングル<u>みくふぉと未公開集</u>やっていきます！</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">『ジャケット写真編』</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"4613503A-6043-4F89-94F8-E9ABA96F9EDB-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_1.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">下唇噛む癖まで何だか全部キュンとする影さん。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"4821E87F-3684-4AC0-86A2-C2B4D4F51667-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_2.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">ライブでのさりなちゃんの表情が好きです。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"599FB142-25EF-4A7C-A422-F3A56166DCC6\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_3.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">ガイコツさえも味方につける史帆さん。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">CDのご購入はこちらから💿↓</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span dir=\"ltr\">https://www.hmv.co.jp/news/article/2108261022/</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">『ってか編』</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"1642B070-127B-4FC8-B0DD-73746B1A5249-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_4.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">氷のうシスターズ</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"5D588FDB-E214-41DC-B0EB-0B83310F4548-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_5.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">ピンボケも味ということで…</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">ってかのMVはこちらから↓</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/pZDqElqNW34\">https://youtu.be/pZDqElqNW34</a></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">『何度でも何度でも編』</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"AE5907CF-387D-4FCC-9D63-7E60AB1ECC7F-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_6.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">おみそしるちゃん</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"96543C85-FFEE-4028-B1B5-3379973C9F64-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_7.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">なかなか写真撮らせてくれない河田さん。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img id=\"352B4124-D586-47DE-99DC-A48303EA3B8A-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_8.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">カメラ向けたらポージングする丹生さん。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">何度でも何度でものMVはこちらから↓</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/iKa0B66oQAQ\">https://youtu.be/iKa0B66oQAQ</a></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">『特典映像編』</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><img id=\"13038608-5FD6-4B19-8211-516D8E79D312-L0-001\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_9.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">まだブログでは書いていなかったのですが特典映像の「<b>ひなたの夏休み</b>」が最高です。</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">ただただ夏休みを満喫しました。笑</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">金村はラフティングに参加しています〜🚣‍♀</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><img id=\"BD2C50C7-D342-42C2-8963-835225E2FDF0\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2021-10-27/41481_10.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">マイカメラで写真もたくさん撮ったので使われているといいな。良い写真たくさん撮れました。</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">全タイプ内容が違うので是非揃えて見てね🎆 &nbsp;</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">予告編はこちらから↓</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/uLg-mhPu_QY\">https://youtu.be/uLg-mhPu_QY</a></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そしてタイトルの通り丸わかりブログなので、</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">今出ている情報を分かりやすくまとめてみました！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">宜しければご活用下さい。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">（どこか抜けていたらすみません</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">！）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">★</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">「ってか」</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">SpecialEdition</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">の配信スタート</span><span class=\"s5\">📱</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">本日発売日になったので、各アプリから曲をダウンロードできるようになりました</span><span class=\"s5\">👏🏻</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">これでスマホでたくさん聴けますね！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">まだの方はこちらから飛べます</span><span class=\"s2\">↓</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><span dir=\"ltr\">https://hinatazaka46.lnk.to/ahpRTWIn</span></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">さらに！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s6\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">ダウンロードするだけ</span><span class=\"s1\">で応募できるキャンペーンや</span><span class=\"s2\">LINE MUSIC</span><span class=\"s1\">で</span><span class=\"s6